The '''Bat Piñata''' is a bat that only appears during the [[Spooky Festival]] and drops {{Item|Green Candy}}. If spawned from a {{Item|Bat Firework}}, it gives {{Item|Purple Candy|amount=5-64}} to the spawner. It also has a low chance of dropping a {{Item|Bat the Fish}}, although the ones spawned from {{Item|Bat Firework}} are immune to damage and therefore cannot drop it.

While they can be spawned using the {{Item|Bat Firework}}, candy collected from these doesn't count towards your Candy Score.

